  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - WebConfigStore<T> is gone. A run answers for its own configuration, so the store was filled by the loaders and read by nothing; read a record with context.Configured<ApiConfig>(\"orders\") instead of resolving a store from the service provider. A malformed entry is now refused when the run composes its resources rather than while the configuration is loaded - still before any step, but BuildServiceProvider() no longer throws. Site entries also carry AllowInvalidCertificates through the run.",
